    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya ahanurira Umwami Ahaziya gupfa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu amaze gutanga, Abamowabu bagomera Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icyo gihe Ahaziya yahanutse mu idirishya ry'insobekerane ry'icyumba cye cyo hejuru i Samariya aragwa, akurizaho kurwara. Bukeye atuma intumwa arazibwira ati “Nimujye kundaguriza Bālizebubi imana ya Ekuroni ko nzakira iyi ndwara.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko marayika w'Uwiteka abwira Eliya w'i Tishubi ati “Haguruka ujye guhura n'intumwa z'umwami w'i Samariya, uzibwire uti ‘Mbese icyatumye mujya kuraguza Bālizebubi ikigirwamana cya Ekuroni, ni uko nta Mana iri muri Isirayeli?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icyo ni cyo gitumye Uwiteka avuga ngo ‘Ntuzabyuka ku gisasiro uryamyeho, ahubwo uzapfa nta kibuza.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Eliya aragenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intumwa zirakimirana zigaruka ku mwami, arazibaza ati “Mugaruwe n'iki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziramubwira ziti “Twahuye n'umugabo aratubwira ati ‘Nimugarukire aho musubire ku mwami wabatumye, mumubwire muti: Uwiteka avuze ngo mbese icyatumye wohereza abo kuraguza Bālizebubi ikigirwamana cya Ekuroni, ni uko nta Mana iri muri Isirayeli? Ngo ni cyo gituma utazabyuka ku gisasiro uryamyeho, uzapfa nta kibuza.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
