              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami arongera amutumaho undi mutware utwara ingabo mirongo itanu ari kumwe n'ingabo ze. Araza aramubwira ati “Yewe muntu w'Imana, umwami aradutumye ngo ‘Manuka vuba umwitabe.’ ”",
